{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05539","headline":"送友人下第归省 · 殷遥","name":"送友人下第归省","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君此卜行日，高堂应梦归。\n莫将和氏泪，滴着老莱衣。\n岳雨连河细，田禽出麦飞。\n到家调膳後，吟好送斜晖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷遥","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05539.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05539","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据《唐诗鉴赏辞典》（周啸天主编，商务印书馆国际有限公司，2012年1月版）「送友人下第归省」条，撰者星　汉、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"星 汉"}